                      (    forth6809.asm):01794         ; DEPTH itself uses, rather than assuming a fixed starting
                      (    forth6809.asm):01795         ; depth - robust regardless of whatever is already on the stack
                      (    forth6809.asm):01796         ; when this test runs. Also verifies DEPTH's own net effect
                      (    forth6809.asm):01797         ; (exactly one cell pushed) and that the three items pushed to
                      (    forth6809.asm):01798         ; set up the test are left undisturbed.
                      (    forth6809.asm):01799         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
