                      (    forth6809.asm):14979         ; sections. Combined into one test, given each word's own
                      (    forth6809.asm):14980         ; effect is trivially verified by reading BASE directly - four
                      (    forth6809.asm):14981         ; separate tests would just repeat the same save/set/verify/
                      (    forth6809.asm):14982         ; restore shape four times over. TSTBASAV (added in section
