                      (    forth6809.asm):20430                      ; replaced by the substitution text (count incremented);
                      (    forth6809.asm):20431                      ; a non-matching name is passed through unchanged,
                      (    forth6809.asm):20432                      ; delimiters and all (count unchanged); an unpaired
                      (    forth6809.asm):20433                      ; trailing '%' with no closing delimiter passes the
                      (    forth6809.asm):20434                      ; residue through unchanged. Confirmed via MAME testing
                      (    forth6809.asm):20435                      ; against a real template. GLOBALS is fully packed
