                      (    forth6809.asm):20439                      ; running substitution count, MSCR3/MSCR4 = local scratch
                      (    forth6809.asm):20440                      ; per %-pair found. Reuses the existing COMPAREW for name
                      (    forth6809.asm):20441                      ; matching rather than a new comparison loop.
