                      (    forth6809.asm):21187                                      ; growing upward from PAD itself, distinct
                      (    forth6809.asm):21188                                      ; from HOLDMINSIZE above (which answers
                      (    forth6809.asm):21189                                      ; for a different region entirely, the
                      (    forth6809.asm):21190                                      ; downward-growing pictured-numeric buffer
                      (    forth6809.asm):21191                                      ; in the CODEHERE-to-PAD gap). PADOFFSET
                      (    forth6809.asm):21192                                      ; happens to equal PADMINSIZE numerically
                      (    forth6809.asm):21193                                      ; in this implementation (PADOFFSET EQU
