                      (    forth6809.asm):21200                                      ; WORDLISTS, this is a CORE query, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):21201                                      ; tied to an unimplemented optional word
                      (    forth6809.asm):21202                                      ; set, so "false by omission" wasn't the
                      (    forth6809.asm):21203                                      ; right default). Investigated by tracing
                      (    forth6809.asm):21204                                      ; DIVCOMMON (shared by /, MOD, /MOD)
                      (    forth6809.asm):21205                                      ; against this system's own SM/REM and
                      (    forth6809.asm):21206                                      ; FM/MOD: DIVCOMMON restores the
                      (    forth6809.asm):21207                                      ; remainder's sign from DNSIGN (the
                      (    forth6809.asm):21208                                      ; dividend's own original sign) after
                      (    forth6809.asm):21209                                      ; dividing absolute values - exactly
                      (    forth6809.asm):21210                                      ; SM/REM's own logic, confirmed identical
                      (    forth6809.asm):21211                                      ; by direct comparison. FM/MOD, by
                      (    forth6809.asm):21212                                      ; contrast, has an explicit flooring
                      (    forth6809.asm):21213                                      ; adjustment step (correcting the
                      (    forth6809.asm):21214                                      ; quotient and remainder when the
                      (    forth6809.asm):21215                                      ; quotient would be negative with a
                      (    forth6809.asm):21216                                      ; nonzero remainder) that DIVCOMMON does
                      (    forth6809.asm):21217                                      ; not have. This system's primary
                      (    forth6809.asm):21218                                      ; division words (/, MOD, /MOD) use
                      (    forth6809.asm):21219                                      ; symmetric division, not floored -
                      (    forth6809.asm):21220                                      ; FLOORED is 0 (false), a real, meaningful
                      (    forth6809.asm):21221                                      ; answer (recognized query, value false),
                      (    forth6809.asm):21222                                      ; not the "unrecognized" fallthrough
                      (    forth6809.asm):21223                                      ; WORDLISTS correctly uses.
